      "output": "Nessus was able to determine that a version of Apache Log4j between 2.0-beta9 and 2.15.0 is installed on the remote host.\n\nInstalled path : /opt/app/lib/log4j-core-2.14.1.jar\nInstalled version : 2.14.1\nFixed version    : 2.17.1",
